        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001002",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1715515200,
        "markText": "雨停的时候，窗台边缘还挂着很小的一串水。",
        "range": "646-686",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001003",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1655121600,
        "markText": "我把地址核对了又核对，仍然不敢投进邮筒。",
        "range": "917-957",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001004",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1720958400,
        "markText": "浅蓝信封比信纸先旧。",
        "range": "1171-1195",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001005",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1692100800,
        "markText": "邮票贴在右上角，歪了一点，我决定不重贴。",
        "range": "1427-1467",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001006",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1726488000,
        "markText": "远方不一定很远，有时只是迟了回信。",
        "range": "1698-1732",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001007",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1760702400,
        "markText": "铁盒盖子合不严，我用一根皮筋箍上。",
        "range": "1951-1985",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001008",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1710763200,
        "markText": "她写到院子里的桂花，没有写自己的近况。",
        "range": "2200-2238",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001009",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1618833600,
        "markText": "我在空白处画了一小条波浪，表示我在听。",
        "range": "2473-2511",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001010",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1715342400,
        "markText": "未寄出的信里有一句道歉，后来被我删掉了。",
        "range": "2722-2762",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001011",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 101,
        "chapterIdx": 1,
        "createTime": 1654948800,
        "markText": "邮箱是绿色的，钥匙却一直找不到。",
        "range": "2992-3024",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001012",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 102,
        "chapterIdx": 2,
        "createTime": 1720785600,
        "markText": "把信读出声的时候，房间好像比刚才小。",
        "range": "126-162",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001013",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 103,
        "chapterIdx": 3,
        "createTime": 1691928000,
        "markText": "有一封短得只剩问候，我却读了很久。",
        "range": "129-163",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001014",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 104,
        "chapterIdx": 4,
        "createTime": 1726315200,
        "markText": "我把旧信按季节分开，春天的那叠最薄。",
        "range": "131-167",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001015",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 105,
        "chapterIdx": 5,
        "createTime": 1760529600,
        "markText": "夜航只被提到一次，我就记住了整页。",
        "range": "129-163",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
        "bookmarkId": "BM99000001016",
        "bookId": "99000001",
        "chapterUid": 102,
        "chapterIdx": 2,
        "createTime": 1710590400,
        "markText": "纸边起了毛，摸上去像话没有说完。",
        "range": "398-430",
        "type": 1,
        "colorStyle": 0
      },
      {
